200:  *
201:  * This overload loads the QSS template for the specified theme and replaces color tokens
202:  * using the provided palette. If the palette is empty or no template is found for the theme,
203:  * it falls back to loading the base QSS only (without theme-specific colors).
204:  *
205:  * After applying the stylesheet, the function also configures theme-dependent ribbon bar
206:  * properties: tab bar margins, context category colors, context category highlight function,
207:  * and tab bar baseline color.
208:  *
209:  * @param w The widget that receives the QSS stylesheet
210:  * @param bar The SARibbonBar whose theme-dependent properties are configured (may be null)
